WEBVTT

00:05:29.068 --> 00:05:33.349
but I am here to talk about
this more human phenomenon of shame,

00:05:34.590 --> 00:05:38.315
because shame is the crucial point

00:05:38.339 --> 00:05:42.438
at which food actually
disappears off your plate.

00:05:43.444 --> 00:05:44.900
What does shame do?

00:05:45.845 --> 00:05:48.512
Shame makes you feel small,

00:05:48.536 --> 00:05:50.071
sad,

00:05:50.095 --> 00:05:51.317
not worthy,

00:05:51.341 --> 00:05:52.715
subhuman.

00:05:53.543 --> 00:05:57.549
Shame creates a cognitive dissonance.

00:05:58.115 --> 00:05:59.906
It distorts food stories.